# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
#
# packages/plugin/lib/ is deliberately TRACKED, not ignored: `dsh plugin add
# file:<repo>` and `dsh plugin add github:<owner>/<repo>` both install the
# root package without running any lifecycle script (pnpm runs none for
# `file:` directory deps and blocks git-hosted builds behind allowBuilds), so
# the shipped artifacts have to already exist in the checkout. Rebuild with
# `pnpm build` after every source change and commit the result —
# test/lib-fresh.test.ts fails when lib/ no longer matches src/.
packages/plugin/bin/
packages/plugin/README.md
packages/plugin/README.zh-CN.md
packages/plugin/LICENSE
legacy/agent/.gotmp/

# Logs / local state
*.log

